---
// Shot.astro - the app's own window, as its tests draw it
---

<div class="container">
  <figure class="shot">
    <img
      src="/shots/traffic.webp"
      width="1600"
      height="1000"
      alt="tracewing's window: a list of requests, with one request's JSON body laid out beside it."
      loading="eager"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <figcaption>
      The window as the app's own tests draw it, with no display attached.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</div>

<style>
  .shot {
    margin: 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
      0 40px 80px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
      0 0 120px -40px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .shot figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
</style>
